      "updated": 1794900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "12-Second Slot Pipeline & 32-Slot Epoch Rhythm (Mainnet Fulu)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "12-Second Slot Pipeline & 32-Slot Epoch Rhythm (Mainnet Fulu)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cons_sbody_0068",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1248,
      "y": 1008,
      "width": 976,
      "height": 149,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "cons_grp_0055"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "d0069",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1634880300,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1188201665,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 1 Slot = 12s (SLOT_DURATION_MS: 12000)   |   1 Epoch = 32 Slots = 6.4 min   |   Sync Period = 256 Epochs (~27.3h)\n\u2022 Intra-slot timing:  [0s] Block Proposal  \u2500\u2500\u25b6  [4s / 3333 BPS] Attestations  \u2500\u2500\u25b6  [8s / 6667 BPS] Aggregates & Sync Contribs\n\u2022 Note: Gloas (ePBS) shifts deadlines to  25% (3s) Bid/Block \u00b7 50% (6s) Payload Reveal \u00b7 75% (9s) PTC Attestation.\n\u2022 64 attestation subnets per slot aggregate BLS votes before inclusion in subsequent BeaconBlocks.",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 1 Slot = 12s (SLOT_DURATION_MS: 12000)   |   1 Epoch = 32 Slots = 6.4 min   |   Sync Period = 256 Epochs (~27.3h)\n\u2022 Intra-slot timing:  [0s] Block Proposal  \u2500\u2500\u25b6  [4s / 3333 BPS] Attestations  \u2500\u2500\u25b6  [8s / 6667 BPS] Aggregates & Sync Contribs\n\u2022 Note: Gloas (ePBS) shifts deadlines to  25% (3s) Bid/Block \u00b7 50% (6s) Payload Reveal \u00b7 75% (9s) PTC Attestation.\n\u2022 64 attestation subnets per slot aggregate BLS votes before inclusion in subsequent BeaconBlocks.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.32
    },
