      "text": "1. Deposit (EL Request) \u2500\u2500\u25b6  2. Pending Queue (churn-limited) \u2500\u2500\u25b6  3. Active Duty (attest / propose / sync, earn rewards)\n4. Voluntary or EL-Triggered Exit (EIP-7002) \u2500\u2500\u25b6  5. Exited + Withdrawable (after MIN_VALIDATOR_WITHDRAWABILITY_DELAY: 256 epochs)\n\u2022 Sweeps automatically push excess balances (>MaxEB) and exited stakes to EL execution withdrawal addresses every slot.",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Deposit (EL Request) \u2500\u2500\u25b6  2. Pending Queue (churn-limited) \u2500\u2500\u25b6  3. Active Duty (attest / propose / sync, earn rewards)\n4. Voluntary or EL-Triggered Exit (EIP-7002) \u2500\u2500\u25b6  5. Exited + Withdrawable (after MIN_VALIDATOR_WITHDRAWABILITY_DELAY: 256 epochs)\n\u2022 Sweeps automatically push excess balances (>MaxEB) and exited stakes to EL execution withdrawal addresses every slot.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.32
    },
