      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 Discovery: discv5 DHT + ENR attnets/syncnets/cgc metadata\n\u2022 GossipSub topics: beacon_block, beacon_aggregate_and_proof,\n  64 beacon_attestation_{subnet}, data_column_sidecar_{i}\n\u2022 ReqResp RPC (ssz_snappy): Status, BeaconBlocksByRange,\n  BeaconBlocksByRoot, DataColumnSidecarsByRange\n\u2022 Checkpoint Sync downloads recent finalized state safely",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 Discovery: discv5 DHT + ENR attnets/syncnets/cgc metadata\n\u2022 GossipSub topics: beacon_block, beacon_aggregate_and_proof,\n  64 beacon_attestation_{subnet}, data_column_sidecar_{i}\n\u2022 ReqResp RPC (ssz_snappy): Status, BeaconBlocksByRange,\n  BeaconBlocksByRoot, DataColumnSidecarsByRange\n\u2022 Checkpoint Sync downloads recent finalized state safely",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.32
    },
